config OUR_LED_SENSOR
	bool "LED sensor driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_OUR_LED_SENSOR_ENABLED
	depends on SENSOR
	select GPIO
	help
	  Enable the sensor driver backed by an on-board LED. Fetching a
	  sample turns the LED on and reading the channel turns it off.
